// The definitions of a lead's sub-program of A03/parent.mdt (A03): an
// application of Each, which its envelope lists, so that its expansion has
// the pattern's stages and its report, to the owner's role. Only its
// definitions are read.

mandate @ 0.7

module example.shaped.plan_1 @ 0.1

use example.shaped

workflow Look = Each(work: Worker.look, width: 2, reviewer: owner_role)
  caps   M, R
  budget { tokens: 2000, time: 10m, spend: 2 USD, steps: 10, agents: 2 }
